  <dashboards>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Hillstrom Email Experiment'>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='table'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_8' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='900' maxwidth='1100' minheight='900' minwidth='1100' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6778' id='3' type-v2='text' w='87600' x='6100' y='2333'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='18'>Send the Mens email to everyone:</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='18'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#2e5c8a' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='18'>+$19K</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='18'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='18'>extra profit</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='17667' id='4' name='Lift with range' w='88909' x='5455' y='8889'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='22222' id='6' name='Extra profit' w='89273' x='5545' y='66667' />
        <zone h='31111' id='7' name='Lift by customer group' w='43818' x='5455' y='30889' />
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='29667' id='8' type-v2='text' w='40000' x='54636' y='31222'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f2a37' fontsize='13'>Key findings</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='6'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1f2a37' fontsize='11'><![CDATA[• Both emails really work: the gaps are not luck (p < 0.001).]]></run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='6'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1f2a37' fontsize='11'>• Mens: +0.68 pp conversion, surely above the +0.3 pp “worth it” line.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='6'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1f2a37' fontsize='11'>• Womens: +0.31 pp, but uncertain: the range crosses the line.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='6'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1f2a37' fontsize='11'>• The Womens email barely works for men’s-only buyers (+0.06 pp).</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='6'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1f2a37' fontsize='11'>• Targeting by group adds only 1%, so keep it simple.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6556' id='9' type-v2='text' w='90545' x='5091' y='91444'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Data: MineThatData email experiment (Kevin Hillstrom, 2008), 64,000 customers split at random into 3 groups. Ranges are 95% confidence intervals. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#898989' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Profit assumes $0.01 per email and a 40% margin.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='900' minheight='900' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='15' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
